       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed issue with Mantis Traitor battle becoming unbeatable.: Note: One known issue as of this version - A room in the Crystal Peak is not displaying on the map. This will be corrected as of version 1.0.0.8",
